---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DISCLAIMER } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About | Grand Strategy Hub" description="Learn about Grand Strategy Hub, a guide site for Europa Universalis IV, Europa Universalis V, and Crusader Kings III." />
		<style>
			main {
				width: 720px;
			}
			h1 {
				margin-bottom: 1em;
			}
			p {
				line-height: 1.7;
				margin-bottom: 1.5em;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About Grand Strategy Hub</h1>
			<p>
				Grand Strategy Hub is a focused guide site covering Paradox Interactive's grand
				strategy games — specifically Europa Universalis IV, Europa Universalis V, and
				Crusader Kings III.
			</p>
			<p>
				Our goal is simple: to provide clear, practical, and accurate guides and mechanics
				explainers for players of these games. Whether you're a new player trying to figure
				out trade, a returning EU4 player curious about what changed in EU5, or a CK3 player
				looking to understand succession, we aim to have a guide that helps.
			</p>
			<p>
				We focus on these three games because they share a publisher, a game engine, and a
				lot of overlapping terminology and audience. That focus lets us go deeper on the
				topics that matter to players rather than spreading thin across many games.
			</p>
			<p>{SITE_DISCLAIMER}</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>